:: Bailey Whitney Office Clean
<<pass 15>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<endevent>>

<<npc Whitney 1>><<person1>>
<<if $whitney_bailey_met gte 1>>
	Whitney doesn't argue. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> grabs a rag from the shelf without being told where it is.
<<else>>
	Whitney stands there for a moment. Then <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> grabs a rag from the shelf.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<npc Bailey 2>><<person2>>
You clean Bailey's desk together. Bailey doesn't move <<his>> papers. You work around them. Whitney scrubs the other end without looking at you.
<br><br>

The only sound is the scratch of Bailey's pen and the wet drag of rags on wood.
<br><br>

<<person1>>
Whitney finishes first. <<He>> drops the rag on the shelf and stands there, jaw tight, waiting.
<br><br>

<<person2>>
Bailey doesn't look up. <<He>> turns a page. <<if $whitney_bailey_met gte 1>>Whitney leaves without a word.<<else>>Whitney leaves. The tips of <<his>> ears are red.<</if>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><<ldom>><<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<set $bailey_dom += 1>><<gdom "Bailey">>
<br><br>

You finish cleaning. Bailey still doesn't look up.
<br><br>

"Go to bed," <<he>> says.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
